    const flows = [{"name":"Sign In & Registration","slug":"sign-in","intro":"How a student gets into the portal: creating an account in three steps, signing in as a returning student, and recovering a forgotten password.","screens":[{"p":4,"title":"Step 1 · Create Account","body":"New students start here. Step 1 collects nationality, SA ID or passport number, phone number and email address. Proceed stays inactive until the form is complete, with Google and Apple as sign-up alternatives."},{"p":5,"title":"Step 1 · Country Selector","body":"The country of citizenship list opens with flags for quick scanning. The selection sets the fee plan: SA standard rates, SADC discounted plans or international fees."},{"p":6,"title":"Step 2 · Verify OTP & Create Password","body":"A 6-digit OTP confirms the phone number, with a resend timer and an option to change the number. The student then sets a password against live strength rules."},{"p":7,"title":"Step 3 · Confirm Details & Accept Terms","body":"A final check of nationality, ID and contact details, with edits allowed. The student accepts the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy before continuing to the application."},{"p":8,"title":"Returning Student · Sign In","body":"Returning students sign in with a passport number, ID number or email address and a password. Google and Apple sign-in and a forgotten password link sit below."},{"p":10,"title":"Create New Password","body":"The student sets a new password against the same strength rules used at sign-up, then confirms it."}]},{"name":"Student Application","slug":"application","intro":"The admission journey for a new student, from account creation through the five application steps to review and an admission offer.","screens":[{"p":12,"title":"Account Created","body":"The first screen after sign-up. It sets expectations (4 steps, about 5 minutes) and lets the student start now or come back later."},{"p":13,"title":"Step 1 · Personal Details","body":"Bio data and home address. Details from sign-up are pre-filled, and ID is checked against Home Affairs records."},{"p":15,"title":"Step 2 · Academic History","body":"With results entered, the portal calculates a preliminary APS score to show faculty eligibility."},{"p":16,"title":"Step 3 · Programme Selection","body":"The student picks a study mode and an NQF-aligned course. The minimum APS requirement is checked instantly."},{"p":17,"title":"Step 4 · Document Uploads","body":"Certified documents are uploaded by drag-and-drop, with format limits and a clear upload status for each file."},{"p":18,"title":"Step 5 · Summary & Review","body":"A full review of every section with inline edit. Submission stays disabled until the declaration is confirmed."},{"p":20,"title":"Application Under Review","body":"After submission: auto-check results, the assigned reviewer, expected response time and a live application timeline."},{"p":21,"title":"Admission Offer","body":"The decision screen: offer summary, accept-by deadline, admission letter download and the Year 1 fee breakdown."}]},{"name":"Dashboard","slug":"dashboard","intro":"How the dashboard adapts to where the student is: pre-admission, semester break, an active semester, and the AI Assist study features.","screens":[{"p":23,"title":"New Student · Application Not Started","body":"Academic modules stay locked. The dashboard points the student to start their application, and the AI notes it is still learning about them."},{"p":24,"title":"New Student · Application Under Review","body":"The dashboard shows application progress (submitted, documents, review, approved) with a shortcut to track it."},{"p":25,"title":"Returning Student · Semester Break","body":"Metrics reset and friendly empty states replace study focus, grades and the study week until the new semester begins."},{"p":27,"title":"Returning Student · Active Semester","body":"The full dashboard: key metrics, today's study focus, recently graded work, the study week and the AI pre-brief."},{"p":28,"title":"AI Assist · Today's Pre-Brief","body":"Opening Ask AI expands the pre-brief into a side panel, with suggested tasks and a prompt to plan the day."},{"p":29,"title":"AI Assist · Personalised Study Plan","body":"After the student says yes, the AI recommends a task order based on past study sessions, with time and confidence estimates."}]},{"name":"Courses","slug":"courses","intro":"From registering for a new semester to working inside a course: lessons, live classes, assignments, the syllabus and proctored exams.","screens":[{"p":32,"title":"Registration Open","body":"When registration opens, a banner shows the deadline and the Register Courses action. The page tracks credits earned towards the degree and splits courses into Undertaking, Passed and Outstanding."},{"p":36,"title":"Course Selection · Courses Selected","body":"Courses are picked with filters for compulsory, elective and department. A running count tracks courses and credits."},{"p":39,"title":"Registration Successful","body":"A celebratory success state confirms the courses have been registered."},{"p":40,"title":"Semester Started · Week 1","body":"Registered courses now appear as cards with module progress, alongside today's priorities and the AI pre-brief."},{"p":43,"title":"Study Lessons","body":"Inside a course: weekly stats, tabbed navigation and the week's read and watch lessons, with completion states."},{"p":47,"title":"Watch Lesson","body":"Video lessons play in a focused player with estimated watch time and a download option."},{"p":49,"title":"Live Class","body":"The live classroom: shared slides, lecturer and student video, class chat and Q&A, and hand-raising."},{"p":51,"title":"Assignment · PDF Brief","body":"A written assignment with the brief, an attached PDF, submission rules and an upload area. AI Assist shows the grading rubric and offers a draft review."},{"p":53,"title":"Assignment · Multiple Choice","body":"Question-by-question answering with a navigator that tracks answered, flagged and remaining questions."},{"p":57,"title":"Exam Lobby · System Check","body":"Before starting, the camera, microphone and student presence are checked and the integrity rules are shown."},{"p":58,"title":"Exam In Progress","body":"The proctored exam: countdown timer, live invigilator video, question navigator, rich-text answers and autosave."}]},{"name":"Calendar","slug":"calendar","intro":"One calendar for every class, deadline and exam, viewable by day, week, month or the whole semester, with filters and Google Calendar sync.","screens":[{"p":60,"title":"Week View","body":"The calendar opens on the current week, with today highlighted and each class colour-coded by course."},{"p":63,"title":"Day View","body":"A single-day timeline for a focused look at today's schedule."},{"p":64,"title":"Month View","body":"The whole month at a glance, with lectures, assignments, assessments and exams on their dates."},{"p":65,"title":"Semester Timetable","body":"A course's full semester, week by week. Completed items are checked off and holiday breaks are clearly marked."},{"p":69,"title":"Exam Details Panel","body":"Selecting the exam opens a side panel with session details, integrity rules and a shortcut into the exam lobby."}]},{"name":"Grades & Audit","slug":"grades","intro":"Grades by year and semester, a per-course breakdown of assignments, assessments and exams, detailed result reviews, and the official semester result.","screens":[{"p":71,"title":"Grades Overview","body":"A year selector and level progress sit above four summary cards: current grade, credits left to qualification, GPA points and total credits accumulated."},{"p":72,"title":"Course Grades · Assignments","body":"One course's grade summary (current grade, class average, GPA) and each assignment's status: graded, missing with a late-submit option, or pending."},{"p":75,"title":"Graded Assignment · Written","body":"The assignment brief alongside the graded submission, the student's file and the score."},{"p":78,"title":"Multiple Choice Result","body":"A question-by-question review. Correct answers are marked green in the navigator and on the chosen option."},{"p":80,"title":"Final Exam Result","body":"The full exam review: 50 questions colour-coded correct or failed, with the student's written answer for each."}]},{"name":"Finance","slug":"finance","intro":"Fees and payments in one place: the balance due, every payment received, and proof of payment submitted and tracked through to approval.","screens":[{"p":83,"title":"Outstanding Fees","body":"The finance overview shows the total balance due, the amount paid and the next due date, flagged when it is overdue. Outstanding Fees lists each fee with its total, net payable, paid and outstanding amounts, and a Pay Now action."},{"p":84,"title":"Payment History","body":"Payment History lists every payment received, with the date, reference, fee, payment method and amount, and a receipt for each."},{"p":86,"title":"Submit Proof of Payment","body":"A short guide explains the process: upload proof, admin review, then confirmation by SMS and email."},{"p":87,"title":"Choosing a Payment Method","body":"The payment method list offers EFT or online banking, bank deposit and cash deposit."},{"p":90,"title":"Submission Pending Review","body":"The submitted payment appears in the history with its method, payment date, amount and submission date, marked Pending until an admin reviews it."}]},{"name":"Library","slug":"library","intro":"Find, reserve and borrow books, then manage bookmarks, loans and library fees in one place.","screens":[{"p":92,"title":"Library Home","body":"Book search with subject quick links, a snapshot of loans, holds and fines, and recommended books to bookmark or reserve."},{"p":93,"title":"Browse by Subject","body":"A subject view (Engineering) showing each book's format and availability: reserve, unavailable, or ready for pickup."},{"p":94,"title":"My Bookmarks","body":"Saved books with type, availability and return window, plus the right action for each: reserve, pick up, download or read."},{"p":95,"title":"Loaned Books","body":"Loan and due dates with clear status (overdue or returned) and quick actions to view details, pay overdue fines or renew."}]},{"name":"Mentorship","slug":"mentorship","intro":"Browse mentors by focus area, book a session from their live availability, and keep track of every session in one place.","screens":[{"p":98,"title":"Book a Session","body":"Mentors are listed with today's availability. Picking one shows their weekly calendar of open and busy slots, a choice of physical, video or voice session, and a booking summary."},{"p":99,"title":"Booking Successful","body":"A success state confirms the session has been booked."},{"p":101,"title":"My Sessions","body":"All sessions in one panel, filtered by live, booked or ended, with a one-tap Join for a session that is live now."}]},{"name":"Work Integrated Learning","slug":"internships","intro":"Registering an internship placement, getting it approved, and keeping a daily logbook that supervisors verify.","screens":[{"p":103,"title":"Not Registered","body":"Before registering, the page explains what details are needed and shows the registration deadline."},{"p":104,"title":"Register Internship","body":"Pick an approved organization or enter your own, then add the school supervisor, start and end dates, responsibilities and the acceptance letter."},{"p":106,"title":"Awaiting Approval","body":"The registration sits in the coordinator's queue, with a summary of the submitted details."},{"p":108,"title":"Logbook Overview","body":"This week's attendance at a glance, then each week's daily logs with supervisor sign-off and notes."},{"p":110,"title":"Daily Log · Filled","body":"Tasks added for the day with attachments, hours worked and skills gained, ready to submit for verification."}]},{"name":"Documents & E-Sign","slug":"documents","intro":"Every official document in one place: what needs signing, what is verified on file, and credentials the student can share.","screens":[{"p":112,"title":"Documents Overview","body":"Documents awaiting signature with deadlines, all verified files with their status, and shareable credentials."},{"p":113,"title":"Document Viewer","body":"A document opens in a focused viewer with its signed status and a download option."}]},{"name":"Inbox and Help & Support","slug":"inbox","intro":"Messages from lecturers and university offices, and a help centre for getting answers fast.","screens":[{"p":115,"title":"Inbox","body":"All messages with unread markers and filters by category: academic, financial, internship, library and system."},{"p":116,"title":"Help & Support","body":"Search with suggested questions, chat, tickets or advisor messaging, FAQs, and the student's active support requests."}]},{"name":"Profile","slug":"profile","intro":"The student's profile at a glance, with notification and account settings.","screens":[{"p":118,"title":"Profile & Settings","body":"Profile details and key academic stats, notification preferences, and account security (password, two-factor authentication and language)."},{"p":119,"title":"Changes Saved","body":"A success state confirms the profile changes have been saved."}]}];
